sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant You
    participant MH as MetaHarness
    participant Mem as Shared memory
    participant pi
    participant Codex
    participant CC as Claude Code
    You->>MH: run 1 · brief (read-only)
    MH->>Mem: retrieve for this task
    Mem-->>MH: the Spring Sale record
    MH->>pi: task + what memory holds
    pi-->>MH: the rules, cited
    MH->>Mem: save the answer
    You->>MH: run 2 · build (edits files)
    MH-->>You: approval needed
    You->>MH: approve
    MH->>Codex: task + record + the brief
    Codex-->>MH: pricing.py changed
    MH->>MH: run the host check
    MH->>Mem: save the answer
    You->>MH: run 3 · review (read-only)
    MH->>CC: task + record + brief + build
    CC-->>MH: rule-by-rule verdict
    MH->>Mem: save the answer
